<figure class="rop-basics">
  <div class="rop-basics__viewport">
    <svg
      class="rop-basics__diagram"
      viewBox="0 0 1080 300"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      role="img"
      aria-label="入力の検査を行うユースケースの手前の境界の後ろに、成功のレールと失敗のレールがあり、4つの工程のうち3つの工程から失敗のレールへ切り替わる"
    >
      <defs>
        <marker id="rop-success-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" markerWidth="16" markerHeight="16" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rop-basics__success-head"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker id="rop-failure-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" markerWidth="16" markerHeight="16" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rop-basics__failure-head"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker id="rop-boundary-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" markerWidth="14" markerHeight="14" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rop-basics__boundary-head"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <text x="12" y="40" class="rop-basics__zone">ユースケースの手前の境界</text>
      <text x="206" y="40" class="rop-basics__zone">ユースケース</text>
      <text x="236" y="68" class="rop-basics__success-label">成功のレール</text>
      <text x="224" y="276" class="rop-basics__failure-label">失敗のレール</text>

      <g class="rop-basics__boundary" transform="translate(12 78)">
        <rect width="140" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="70" y="38" text-anchor="middle">入力を検査する</text>
        <text x="70" y="60" text-anchor="middle">レールには乗らない</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M 152 118 H 204" class="rop-basics__boundary-arrow"></path>

      <path d="M 206 118 H 1000" class="rop-basics__success-rail"></path>
      <path d="M 206 236 H 1000" class="rop-basics__failure-rail"></path>
      <text x="1008" y="124" class="rop-basics__endpoint" text-anchor="start">Output</text>

      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(236 78)">
        <rect width="136" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="68" y="47" text-anchor="middle">実行者の確認</text>
      </g>
      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(422 78)">
        <rect width="136" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="68" y="47" text-anchor="middle">予約の確認</text>
      </g>
      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(608 78)">
        <rect width="136" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="68" y="47" text-anchor="middle">結果を作る</text>
      </g>
      <g class="rop-basics__stage" transform="translate(794 78)">
        <rect width="136" height="80" rx="10"></rect>
        <text x="68" y="47" text-anchor="middle">記録して返す</text>
      </g>

      <path data-rop-switch="actor" d="M 372 118 C 382 118, 402 208, 412 236" class="rop-basics__switch"></path>
      <path data-rop-switch="appointment" d="M 558 118 C 568 118, 588 208, 598 236" class="rop-basics__switch"></path>
      <path data-rop-switch="store" d="M 930 118 C 938 118, 954 208, 962 236" class="rop-basics__switch"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    各工程は成功なら上を進み、予想できる失敗なら下へ切り替わります。一度失敗すると、後続の成功処理は飛ばします。入力の検査は、ユースケースの手前の境界で行い、レールには乗りません。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rop-basics {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .rop-basics__viewport {
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 2px solid var(--role-border);
    background: var(--role-surface);
    scrollbar-gutter: stable;
  }

  .rop-basics__diagram {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    height: auto;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .rop-basics figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--role-text) 78%, var(--role-surface));
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .rop-basics__success-rail,
  .rop-basics__failure-rail,
  .rop-basics__switch {
    fill: none;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 5;
  }

  .rop-basics__success-rail {
    stroke: var(--role-positive);
    marker-end: url(#rop-success-arrow);
  }

  .rop-basics__failure-rail,
  .rop-basics__switch {
    stroke: var(--role-negative);
  }

  .rop-basics__failure-rail {
    marker-end: url(#rop-failure-arrow);
  }

  .rop-basics__switch {
    marker-end: url(#rop-failure-switch-arrow);
  }

  .rop-basics__success-head {
    fill: var(--role-positive);
  }

  .rop-basics__failure-head {
    fill: var(--role-negative);
  }

  .rop-basics__boundary rect {
    fill: var(--role-surface);
    stroke: var(--role-border);
    stroke-dasharray: 7 5;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .rop-basics__boundary text {
    fill: var(--role-text);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .rop-basics__boundary-arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--role-border);
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-width: 3;
    marker-end: url(#rop-boundary-arrow);
  }

  .rop-basics__boundary-head {
    fill: var(--role-border);
  }

  .rop-basics__zone {
    fill: var(--role-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .rop-basics__stage rect {
    fill: var(--role-surface);
    stroke: var(--role-border);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .rop-basics__stage text,
  .rop-basics__endpoint {
    fill: var(--role-text);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .rop-basics__endpoint {
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .rop-basics__success-label,
  .rop-basics__failure-label {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .rop-basics__success-label {
    fill: var(--role-positive);
  }

  .rop-basics__failure-label {
    fill: var(--role-negative);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .rop-basics__diagram {
      min-width: 46rem;
    }

    .rop-basics__viewport::after {
      display: block;
      position: sticky;
      right: 0;
      width: max-content;
      margin: -0.25rem 0 0 auto;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
      background: var(--role-border);
      color: var(--role-surface);
      content: "横にスクロール";
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
  }
</style>
